<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Wyndham Hotel started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Wyndham Hotel started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Southwest Securities said it initiated coverage of Wyndham Hotel Corp with a hold rating.</p>
<p>-- set an 18-month price target of $35 a share and set 1998 earnings estimates of $1.12 a share.</p>
</text>
